Z||000000||TheFiero64||09-02-2000||01:42 PM||||There is a car show in Marshfield MA tomorrow. The show runs from 9am to 5pm. You can drive onto the Marshfield Fairgrounds and register starting at 7am. I don't know how much the registration costs, I am guessing 10 bucks. It's the 20th annual Spindles Auto Show and Swap Meet. Rte 139 & 3A. <B>I hope to see a lot of Fiero's there. There will be a Fiero class and Kick-Hill Farms is donating the great trophies</B><P>Here are the Directions<BR>How to get to the MARSHFIELD FAIR GROUNDS *!<P>We are located at the junction of Main Street (Route 3-A) and South River Street in Marshfield, Ma - about 20 Miles South of Boston<P>From Boston, take the Southeast Expressway south to Route 3, follow Route 3 South to Exit 12 in Pembroke, at the bottom of the Exit 12 ramp, take a right onto Route 139 - continue on Route 139 to the traffic lights at the intersection of Route 3-A, take a LEFT onto Route 3-A, we are about a quarter mile up Route 3-A on your RIGHT.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||10
